{"id":"628011","name":"自制甜甜圈","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/628011/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"450g"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"220g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"50g"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"适量（炸制用）"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"个鸡蛋，食用油。","img":"images/628011/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/628011/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛奶，酵母、白糖等搅拌均匀。","img":"images/628011/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入面中和成面絮状。","img":"images/628011/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再反复揉匀，盖上盖子放温暖处发酵。","img":"images/628011/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发酵好的面团。","img":"images/628011/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出放入面案上。","img":"images/628011/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"分成50g/个剂子，揉成小团状饧制一下(覆膜保湿)。","img":"images/628011/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"做成甜甜圈状二次饧发好的面坯。","img":"images/628011/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中油温中小火炸甜甜圈。","img":"images/628011/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"颜色金黄，翻面再炸。","img":"images/628011/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再炸一锅，一共炸了4锅。","img":"images/628011/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"炸好捞出，晾凉后撒薄糖粉，糖针点缀，人人皆宜。","img":"images/628011/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}